# RLM workflow (thin trigger)

Use when an artifact exceeds **~50k characters**. **Full procedure**: [`skills/rlm/SKILL.md`](../skills/rlm/SKILL.md)

- **REPL**: `skills/rlm/scripts/rlm_repl.py` (shared with Claude Code)
- **MCP** (optional): `rlm-repl` in [`.cursor/mcp.json`](../mcp.json)
- **Handoff template**: [`docs/rlm-issue-handoff-template.md`](../../docs/rlm-issue-handoff-template.md)
- **ADR**: [`docs/ADR/ADR-004-rlm-for-long-context-agent-tasks.md`](../../docs/ADR/ADR-004-rlm-for-long-context-agent-tasks.md)

Orchestration: root agent runs REPL + parallel `Task` subagents; never paste raw chunks into main context.
